          "level": 1,
          "content": "Keeping Time with the Skies"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.693,
            0.746,
            0.733
          ],
          "content": "z Have you ever seen the Moon during the day? Why do you think u think it is sometimes visible when the Sun is up?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.736,
            0.745,
            0.775
          ],
          "content": "z Imagine you lived on the Moon instead of Earth. What wou ld you mean by a day, a month or a year?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.778,
            0.745,
            0.818
          ],
          "content": "z What would happen if Earth had two moons instead of one? How would that change the night sky?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.103,
            0.821,
            0.744,
            0.859
          ],
          "content": "z If we didn’t have clocks or calendars, how else co ld u we measure time? C"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.103,
            0.864,
            0.339,
            0.884
          ],
          "content": "z Share your questions"
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
